        "en": "The function dimensionError checks if the target dimensions are valid and if the output will exceed certain limits. It returns an error message if the target dimensions are not positive whole numbers or if the output will exceed 32 million pixels or 64 million pixels for the frame count. Otherwise, it returns null.",
